  "spaceeyes.pconfig.aprendizaje.ayuda": "Before alerting, the device learns what the screen normally looks like. It always learns at least its first pass with the screen working.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.aprendizaje.texto": "How long it watches before it starts alerting.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.ayuda.esquinas": "Click the 4 corners of the screen in order: {orden}. Then you can drag them. Set the cabinet rows and columns so the lines match the seams. If you change the device zoom or lens, you have to mark it again.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.ayuda.orden": "top left, top right, bottom right, bottom left",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.ayuda.zonas": "Click the cabinets that something always blocks (a wall, a tree, a pole): they are not checked. The device also learns them on its own in its first 24 hours.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.camara-bloqueada": "Android does not let it use the camera in the background, so it is not checking the screen. Open the Space Eye app on the phone once and it fixes itself. This happens after the phone restarts, unless the app is the device owner.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.cambiar": "Change screen",
