  "spaceeyes.pconfig.confirmar.texto": "The corners or the cabinets changed, so the device forgets what it had learned. It learns again before it can alert about faults.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.confirmar.titulo": "The screen framing changed",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.descripcion": "The device checks its own screen and only alerts when it confirms a fault or when it is fixed. It sends no video or photos while everything is fine.",
