  "spaceeyes.pconfig.no-sabe": "Fault monitoring needs app 0.15.0 or later on the phone, or agent 0.7.0 on the Raspberry. The PC agent does not have it yet.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.pantalla": "Screen",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.primera-vuelta": "Learning on its first pass: the next one already monitors.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.quietos": "Cabinets that never change (not checked): {lista}. Something usually blocks them; if nothing is in front, check them: they could have been off for a while.",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.rapido": "Alert immediately if the whole screen goes off",
  "spaceeyes.pconfig.rapido.ayuda": "While watching its screen, if the device sees it completely off three times in a row (with light around) it alerts right then, with its photo, without waiting for the next check. At night or with the lens covered it does not alert this way: the usual check decides that.",
